            "info": "Debra Stuart is the CEO of Study Active and a seasoned leader in the health and fitness industry with over 40 years of experience. Her career spans from hands-on roles as a fitness instructor and personal trainer to senior leadership positions shaping national training and education standards. A Chartered Director and Fellow of the Institute of Directors, Debra has played a pivotal role in developing high-quality qualifications and frameworks, including during her tenure as CEO of Premier Global and Treasurer of ukactive. At Study Active, she continues her mission to raise industry standards by promoting accessible, evidence-based education and supporting clear career pathways for future professionals."
